ata-disabled="">Scroll to top<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" height="1.1em" class="x:-rotate-90 x:border x:rounded-full x:border-current"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><article class="x:w-full x:min-w-0 x:break-words x:min-h-[calc(100vh-var(--nextra-navbar-height))] x:text-slate-700 x:dark:text-slate-200 x:pb-8 x:px-4 x:pt-4 x:md:px-12"><div class="nextra-breadcrumb x:mt-1.5 x:flex x:items-center x:gap-1 x:overflow-hidden x:text-sm x:text-gray-600 x:dark:text-gray-400 x:contrast-more:text-current"><a class="x:whitespace-nowrap x:transition-colors x:min-w-6 x:overflow-hidden x:text-ellipsis x:focus-visible:nextra-focus x:ring-inset x:hover:text-gray-900 x:dark:hover:text-gray-100" title="Overview" href="/overview/wbtc-overview">Overview</a><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" height="14" class="x:shrink-0 x:rtl:rotate-180"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="x:whitespace-nowrap x:transition-colors x:font-medium x:text-black x:dark:text-gray-100" title="FAQ">FAQ</span></div><div id="nextra-skip-nav"></div><main data-pagefind-body="true"><h1 class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-bold x:mt-2 x:text-4xl">FAQ</h1>
<div class="faq-list"><h2 id="wbtc-vs-btc-differences" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">WBTC vs BTC Differences?<a href="#wbtc-vs-btc-differences" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2><p class="x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7">BTC is the native asset of the Bitcoin network, while WBTC is a 1:1 multichain token used on smart contract chains like Ethereum, Solana, TRON and BNB.</p><h2 id="why-use-wbtc-instead-of-btc" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">Why use WBTC instead of BTC?<a href="#why-use-wbtc-instead-of-btc" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2><p class="x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7">WBTC provides Bitcoin holders access to DeFi yields, lending, and liquidity pools while maintaining a price pegged to BTC.</p><h2 id="how-to-convert-btc-to-wbtc" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">How to convert BTC to WBTC<a href="#how-to-convert-btc-to-wbtc" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2><p class="x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7">Users can convert BTC to WBTC through supported CEXs, DEXs, or on-chain protocols. During the process, BTC is sent to the other party and an equivalent amount of WBTC is received by the user. (e.g. Binance, Bybit, Bitget, Uniswap, PancakeSwap)</p><h2 id="how-to-convert-wbtc-back-to-btc" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">How to convert WBTC back to BTC?<a href="#how-to-convert-wbtc-back-to-btc" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2><p class="x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7">Users can convert WBTC back to BTC through supported CEXs, DEXs, or on-chain protocols. During the process, WBTC is sent to the other party and an equivalent amount of BTC is received by the user. (e.g. Binance, Bybit, Bitget, Uniswap, PancakeSwap)</p><h2 id="how-is-wbtc-minted" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">How is WBTC minted?<a href="#how-is-wbtc-minted" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2><p class="x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7">WBTC is minted when BTC is deposited through an authorized merchant and verified and released by an authorized custodian. Once the BTC deposit is confirmed, an equivalent amount of WBTC is issued to the user.</p><h2 id="how-is-wbtc-burned" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">How is WBTC burned?<a href="#how-is-wbtc-burned" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2><p class="x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7">WBTC is burned when a user redeems WBTC through an authorized merchant. Once the WBTC is received and burned, the equivalent amount of BTC is released by the authorized custodian to the user.</p><h2 id="how-to-use-bitcoin-in-defi" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">How to use Bitcoin in DeFi?<a href="#how-to-use-bitcoin-in-defi" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2><p class="x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7">Use WBTC as collateral for loans, provide liquidity on DEXs to earn fees, or participate in automated yield-farming strategies. (e.g. Aave, Spark, Morpho, Concrete, Uniswap, PancakeSwap)</p><h2 id="where-can-i-get-wbtc" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">Where can I get WBTC?<a href="#where-can-i-get-wbtc" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2><p class="x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7">WBTC can be acquired through supported CEXS, DEXs, and integrated on-chain protocols across multiple networks. (e.g. Binance, Bybit, Bitget, Uniswap, PancakeSwap)</p><h2 id="what-networks-support-wbtc" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">What networks support WBTC?<a href="#what-networks-support-wbtc" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2><p class="x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7">WBTC is a multi-chain asset available on 25+ blockchains, including Ethereum, Solana, BNB, TRON and many more.</p><h2 id="why-is-wbtc-widely-used-in-defi" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">Why is WBTC widely used in DeFi?<a href="#why-is-wbtc-widely-used-in-defi" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2><p class="x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7">WBTC has broad protocol integrations, deepest liquidity, transparent and verifiable proof of reserves, and a long operational track record, making it one of the most recognized forms of tokenized Bitcoin.</p><h2 id="is-wbtc-safe-to-use" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">Is WBTC safe to use?<a href="#is-wbtc-safe-to-use" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2><p class="x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7">WBTC is the most liquid and integrated tokenized BTC asset, secured by institutional custodians and transparent, verifiable and, public on-chain audits.</p></div></main><div class="x:mt-16"></div><div class="x:mb-8 x:flex x:items-center x:border-t x:pt-8 nextra-border x:print:hidden"><a title="Proof of Reserve" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus x:text-gray-600 x:dark:text-gray-400 x:hover:text-gray-800 x:dark:hover:text-gray-200 x:contrast-more:text-gray-700 x:contrast-more:dark:text-gray-100 x:flex x:max-w-[50%] x:items-center x:gap-1 x:py-4 x:text-base x:font-medium x:transition-colors x:[word-break:break-word] x:md:text-lg x:pe-4" href="/overview/proof-of-reserve-and-transparency-dashboard"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" height="20" class="x:inline x:shrink-0 x:ltr:rotate-180"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Proof of Reserve</a></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--><div class="x:bg-gray-100 x:pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)] x:dark:bg-neutral-900 x:print:bg-transparent"><hr class="nextra-border"/><footer class="x:mx-auto x:flex x:max-w-(--nextra-content-width) x:justify-center x:py-12 x:text-gray-600 x:dark:text-gray-400 x:md:justify-start x:pl-[max(env(safe-area-inset-left),1.5rem)] x:pr-[max(env(safe-area-inset-right),1.5rem)] custom-footer">Copyright © <!-- -->2026<!-- --> WBTC</footer></div><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-7734b665a222b09e.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.f